The plate looks like a small paper plate or bowl, about 15 cm across (roughly 260 px in the image). The cantaloupe chunks cover about 150 px by 130 px, so around 8 cm by 7 cm. There are about 9 chunks, each roughly 3 cm by 2.5 cm by 2 cm. That is about 15 cm³ per chunk, or about 14 g, so the total is about 125 g. Some chunks are stacked, so I settled on about 120 g.

There is also a faint pink residue on the plate, which is negligible.

